{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o084b","title":"曹操南征使刘备投刘表","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o084b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操九月回许后南征刘备，刘备闻曹操亲来而奔刘表，共都等部散去。","evidence":["wudi-e-o084b-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o021c-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"《先主传》记曹操破袁绍后亲自南击刘备。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o021c-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o022a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备遣麋竺、孙乾通刘表；刘表郊迎并增兵，使屯新野。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o022a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"南征","evidence":["wudi-e-o084b-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"退奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o084b-q"]},{"person":"liu-biao","role":"投奔对象","evidence":["wudi-e-o084b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0192","role":"部众散去","evidence":["wudi-e-o084b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0021","role":"通使","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o022a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0027","role":"通使","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o022a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"许、汝南","evidence":["wudi-e-o084b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安六年九月","year":201,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o084b-q","wudi-q-o083","wudi-q-b-9c802125724c98d43dbe"],"chronology":"wudi-y201","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o083","basis":"建安六年九月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,458,"O084b"],"order":200}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-biao","name":"刘表","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0192","name":"共都","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0021","name":"麋竺","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0027","name":"孙乾","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o084b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f1ba2e0f53a15df9cff8","layer":"original","quote":"九月，公还许。绍之未破也，使刘备略汝南；汝南贼共都等应之〖4〗。遣蔡扬击都，不利，为都所破。公南征备。备闻公自行，走奔刘表；都等皆散。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":457,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-9c802125724c98d43dbe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9c802125724c98d43dbe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：建安六年（公元 201）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":460,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9b6cfac8aaa83b85aeb7","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o083","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1558c8ed4ee1b2768986","layer":"original","quote":"六年夏四月〖1〗，扬兵河上〖2〗。击绍仓亭军〖3〗，破之。绍归，复收散卒，攻定诸叛郡县。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o021c-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-89994d2c61c1d14e6400","layer":"original","quote":"曹公既破绍，自南击先主。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-2d6f229edbd08467d35a","layer":"original","quote":"先主遣麋竺、孙乾，与刘表相闻〖6〗。表自郊迎〖7〗，以上宾礼待之；益其兵，使屯新野。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
